'''THE FOLIVOREAN''' (超棘獣ナマケモルガ, ''Chō Kyokujū Namakemoruga'', '''Super Thorn-Beast Namakemoruga''') is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of [[THE SLOTH]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 11.6 Update|Version 11.6]].

